%% Unsloth Training Data Flow
%% Commit: 341ce85864d191e4a6b7c447b9167c1faf5e20d3

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant DataLoader
    participant Tokenizer
    participant Model
    participant Kernels
    participant Optimizer
    participant GPU

    User->>DataLoader: Training data
    DataLoader->>Tokenizer: Raw text
    Tokenizer->>Tokenizer: Tokenize + pad
    Tokenizer->>GPU: Input tensors

    loop Training Loop
        GPU->>Model: Forward pass

        Note over Model: Embedding Layer
        Model->>Kernels: Token embeddings

        loop For each layer (32x)
            Note over Kernels: RMS LayerNorm (Triton)
            Kernels->>Kernels: Normalize

            Note over Kernels: Attention (Flash Attention)
            Kernels->>Kernels: Q/K/V projection
            Kernels->>Kernels: RoPE embeddings
            Kernels->>Kernels: Attention computation
            Kernels->>Kernels: Output projection

            Note over Kernels: MLP (Fast LoRA)
            Kernels->>Kernels: Gate + Up projection
            Kernels->>Kernels: SwiGLU activation
            Kernels->>Kernels: Down projection

            Note over Model: Residual + Checkpoint
        end

        Note over Kernels: Cross-Entropy Loss (Fused)
        Kernels->>Model: Loss value

        Model->>GPU: Backward pass

        Note over Kernels: Fast LoRA Backward (5-10x)
        Kernels->>Kernels: Compute dA, dB

        GPU->>Optimizer: Gradients
        Optimizer->>GPU: Update LoRA weights
    end

    GPU->>User: Trained model
